{
  "dom_id": "step-e12761",
  "name": "Example: Finding the Disjoint Union of Non-Overlapping Sets",
  "problem": "Find the disjoint union of the sets $\\{ -1, 1, \\sqrt{5} \\}$ and $\\{ v, w \\}.$",
  "worked_solution": "Notice that the sets are disjoint since\n\n$$\n\\{ -1, 1, \\sqrt{5} \\} \\cap \\{ v, w \\} = \\emptyset.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the disjoint union is simply the union:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{-1,1,\\sqrt{5}}\u2294{v,w} & ={-1,1,\\sqrt{5}}\\cup {v,w} \\\\  & ={-1,1,\\sqrt{5},v,w}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
